# Clear Glass gig file (clearglass.gig/1) — load it in Settings → Autofill → Gig, or in the gig panel.
format: clearglass.gig/1
platform: fiverr
title: I will build an AI agent workflow that automates your repetitive work
category: Programming & Tech
subcategory: AI Development
tags:
  - ai agent
  - automation
  - chatgpt
  - claude
  - workflow
description: >-
  Repeating the same steps every day? I build AI agent workflows that do them for you, and that
  check their own work before you see it.


  I run my own multi-agent system: it routes each task to Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini or a local model,
  retries the ones that fail, and refuses to call a job done until a test passes. You get the same
  discipline at the size you need.


  What I can build:

  - A workflow that reads, sorts, drafts or summarises (email, documents, data)

  - An agent that uses your tools through an API or a browser

  - A local model fallback, so it keeps working when a service is down

  - Logs that show what the agent did and why


  How it works: you describe the finished result and how you'll check it. I write that down first as
  a short spec, build to it, and show it passing.


  Nothing is sent, posted or deleted without the rule you set.
packages:
  basic:
    name: One Agent Task
    description: One automated task with one AI provider, a run guide and a demo.
    deliveryDays: 3
    revisions: 1
    price: 60
    features:            # Fiverr's package rows for this subcategory, as the page labels them (draft values, to confirm)
      "Number of APIs integrated": 1
      "Number of Triggers / Actions": 3
      "Number of Platform/Tools Integrated": 1
      "Data Syncing": no
      "Conditional Logic": no
  standard:
    name: Multi-Step Workflow
    description: A workflow of up to 4 steps, with checks between steps and a log.
    deliveryDays: 6
    revisions: 2
    price: 180
    features:
      "Number of APIs integrated": 2
      "Number of Triggers / Actions": 4
      "Number of Platform/Tools Integrated": 2
      "Data Syncing": yes
      "Conditional Logic": yes
  premium:
    name: Agent System
    description: Several agents, routing and fallback across providers, tests and a spec.
    deliveryDays: 12
    revisions: 3
    price: 450
    features:
      "Number of APIs integrated": 4
      "Number of Triggers / Actions": 10
      "Number of Platform/Tools Integrated": 4
      "Data Syncing": yes
      "Conditional Logic": yes
faq:
  - question: Which AI providers can you use?
    answer: >-
      Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, DeepSeek and local models through Ollama. You pay for any API keys; I
      set them up with you.
  - question: How do I know it works?
    answer: >-
      Every job has a check we agree on first. I show it passing before delivery, and you get the
      test to run yourself.
  - question: Can it run without the internet?
    answer: >-
      Parts can, on a local model, if your computer can run one. I will tell you up front what to
      expect.
requirements:
  - What should the workflow do from start to finish? Describe one real example of the task.
  - Who will use it, and on what? (Windows, Mac, a server; one person or a team)
  - What must it always do, and what must it never do?
  - How will you check that it is done? (the test you will run, or what you will look at)
  - Please share any files, examples, access or data I need to start.
